WEBVTT

00:30:57.663 --> 00:31:02.996
if not wildly unlikely. And I think
that online, not just the Zoom's,

00:31:02.996 --> 00:31:07.704
but also the sort of online whiteboard
apps that exist that allow people to

00:31:07.704 --> 00:31:09.913
collaborate remotely has, I think,

00:31:10.454 --> 00:31:14.163
probably profoundly changed
the way stories,

00:31:14.538 --> 00:31:17.246
at least on television and writers rooms,
will be broken.

00:31:17.371 --> 00:31:21.329
Wow. Does that does that mean in writers
rooms won't always be physical even

00:31:21.329 --> 00:31:22.329
after the pandemic?

00:31:22.579 --> 00:31:23.954
They definitely will. But I think

00:31:23.954 --> 00:31:27.913
the that someone can now be part
of it who might not be in town.

00:31:28.038 --> 00:31:31.079
I think that that the norm will always
seem to be better to be together.